      "id": "PUB-C01",
      "title": "Publication000 preserves a useful bounded teaching workflow without broad efficacy claims.",
      "assessment": "Task declaration, fixed candidate binding, same-board repair, independent finite predicates, retained failure and explicit UNKNOWN after fuel are reusable pedagogical control mechanisms. Publication form adds no independent correctness, model performance or learner-transfer evidence.",
