            "before": "and matched from below by the unit circulation around `(0,1,2)`. The two face sums are 7 and 5, so Gamma2 of the before vector is 12. Face sums\r\nare unchanged by coboundaries, because d1 composed with d0 is 0. No potential\r\ntakes (3,2,2,1,1) to the zero vector. The jump from those face sums to the\r\nzero vector is a problem change, not an exact repair. The laboratory still\r\nreports final summaries 0 and 0 on that replaced candidate, and admission\r\nstays refused. Gamma2 of the before vector remains 12.\r\n",
