      "assessment": "Complete452-line linked guide read. On the fixed directed additive triangle, potential differences telescope to zero; the displayed potential attains weighted discrepancy3 and the triangle inequality proves the matching lower bound. Replacing claims by(-2,1,1) makes a new consistent instance and does not establish external truth. The session illustrates refusal, nonincrease, unchanged refused state and snapshot restoration, without claiming stationary moves terminate. Native configuration, exact Python enumeration and a plain arithmetic worksheet are distinct routes. Model integration is an implementation suggestion only, and currency/permission/quantum labels do not justify a domain encoding. The prior support audit identifies concrete guard, snapshot, receipt and live-budget gaps; this publication reading does not erase them or rerun historical75-test evidence.",
